      "schema:name": "cat(X)",
      "schema:description": "A free catalyst site to which an RDEt molecule can attach - a different site type than cat(H), which takes hydrogen atoms. A free site is an OccupationState without cpo:occupiedBy; cpo:belongsToInterface is filled in at SeriesSpecific level.",
      "cpo:boundTo": {
