      ],
      "schema:name": "catX-RDEt",
      "schema:description": "An RDEt molecule chemisorbed on a cat(X) site, where it becomes reactive towards RYE and REA. Distinct from cat-RDEt, which is RDEt still sitting on a cat(H) site before desorption. cpo:belongsToInterface is filled in at SeriesSpecific level.",
