          "@id": "reaction:ReactionParticipant_StoichiometricReaction_0002_0004"
        },
        {
          "@id": "reaction:StoichiometricReaction_0002_Participant_Ammonia"
        }
      ],
      "cpo:describedByReactionMechanism": {
        "@id": "reaction:ReactionMechanism_0003"
      },
      "schema:comment": "NH3 added as a by-product by curation on 29.09.2026 (suggested by Claude Code, confirmed by Laura Fadler on 29.09.2026): without it the participants summed to C12H26N4 on the left but only C12H23N3 on the right - an imine condensing with a primary amine releases ammonia. The source scheme leaves it out: the thesis the hydrogenation example comes from (section 3.2, eq. 3.2, following Lapkin's lecture) and the original RO-Crate (hand-made before the generator; not part of this repository). RDEt changed from Reagent to Substrate at the same time. The elementary reaction of the mechanism (reaction:ElementaryReaction_0011) releases NH3 as well (29.09.2026)."
    },
    {
      "@id": "reaction:ReactionParticipant_StoichiometricReaction_0002_0001",
