      "rdfs:comment": "Reaction LCJ-R5 of the collection 'Experiment', status 'done'. Exported by Congjian Lin as a Chemotion collection export (Chemotion collection export d4bbc7cc-bd12-4ff2-85ba-71233b395b31.zip) and given to Laura Fadler as an example on 05.10.2026; the export names no version of Chemotion and no user, only the user's UUID (bf96e4ac-a80d-4544-89f2-51f67653771f). The same user created the analysis datasets, which name 'Congjian Lin' as their creator - the creator of the record is taken from there (suggested by Claude Code on 05.10.2026 for the Chemotion example, not yet confirmed). The library entries it is about were imported from it (schema:about / schema:subjectOf). Its temperature field says 151 °C, its description text 200 °C - read as a copy of LCJ-R4 whose field was changed and whose text was not (Laura Fadler, 05.10.2026).",
