      },
      "schema:comment": "From the ELN (Chemotion LCJ-R5, LCJ-R8): '50 bar H2' in the free text and the atmosphere 'h2' of the segment 'Reaction Details'. Role Reagent by curation: consumed in the hydrogenolysis of the lignin (suggested by Claude Code, confirmed by Laura Fadler on 05.10.2026 for the Chemotion example)."
    },
