      "schema:comment": "From the ELN (Chemotion LCJ-R5, LCJ-R8): '5 wt% Pd/C catalyst' in the free text - the metal of the catalyst (suggested by Claude Code, confirmed by Laura Fadler on 05.10.2026 for the Chemotion example)."
